OL,3,GNEWSAMan left with 'severe' injures
OL,4,Aafter being shot in the leg
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man aged in his 40s has been shot in
OL,7,Fthe leg in west Belfast, which has left
OL,8,Fhim with "severe" injuries, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FIt happened at about 21:30 BST in an
OL,12,Falley between the Falls Road and Ross
OL,13,FRoad on Sunday.
OL,15,FPolice said the attack has "caused fear
OL,16,Fand disruption" in the "very community
OL,17,Fthose responsible for this criminal act
OL,18,Fclaim to protect".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
