OL,3,GNEWSAMan left with 'severe' injures
OL,4,Aafter being shot in the leg
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein MP Paul Maskey condemned the
OL,7,Fshooting and said there is "no place
OL,8,Ffor this type of violence in our
OL,9,Fcommunity".
